    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "Over the past 3 weeks I have been getting episodes 2 or 3 times a week lasting about 30 minutes where I suddenly feel palpitations in my chest. Which service should evaluate this?",
        "sha256": "4641ae3fd36a8bb906a0a99bf18f0ced9dd208671aae511c9e3de2d55bd7e77a",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "for the last 3 weeks ive been getting episodes 2 or 3 times a week lasting about 30 minutes where i suddenly feel my heart doing flip-flops in my chest. who should i get to check this out?",
        "sha256": "c3e32436de8b8ebc2baab0128ea74e7dacfd1bc51db07847c65564ec5c20e9f1",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "I am 64 and take 20 mg of lisinopril every morning for hypertension, and I do not smoke.",
        "sha256": "02b3277a953c4deb2f8e2672bfb6acfbef9458132e0173a09adc9186329397b4",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "im 64 and take 20 mg of lisinopril every morning for high blood pressure, and i dont smoke.",
        "sha256": "1919b0d6d857defaeb131d05364c181d32b43fcce02885185b088cc5fafb277a",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Should I schedule a routine visit with my doctor first, or try to see a specialist directly?",
        "sha256": "76714c2a4d44616cc9e2a8eda7432d8659343492647db72154fbbce4614ea09f",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "should i book a routine visit with my doctor first or try to see a specialist straight away?",
        "sha256": "26b37a2f0c70d8106839d2ab84d5efbe2cef34d83902d4ebe8bc5bec47013ae0",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "During an episode this morning I checked my wrist and felt a fast arrhythmia with no steady beat at all, and my home monitor showed my pulse jumping between 125 and 140.",
        "sha256": "23cedbaa8abbd1258b614c9032f0d0307495cf8cf4bbe5c0920bbe03703f9509",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "during an episode this morning i checked my wrist and felt a fast irregular heartbeat with no steady beat at all, and my home monitor showed my pulse bouncing between 125 and 140.",
        "sha256": "340cd4ad15dc96be2424b0f3a224f9e8e6cbc903d8c2483ba56b86c7a72a69af",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "During today's 30-minute spell I felt noticeably lightheaded standing at the kitchen counter and had exertional dyspnea just walking to the hallway chair.",
        "sha256": "db20434dd1d6017f7e4731ecda5cf3ecee0c740894ccf326114e3edb51061d95",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "during todays 30 minute spell i felt really lightheaded standing at the kitchen counter and got winded just walking to the hallway chair.",
        "sha256": "348881fa3c721ca13f3b65a47e8f8dcd8a8bc52ace62df7dfc10caab11e064cf",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_clinical",
        "text": "Is there anything practical I should do during an episode, such as sitting down or logging the pulse readings?",
        "sha256": "884f10e7285538792cbb631a726214d2c75731d8e93fad33983ffa9187329a97",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t06_colloquial",
        "text": "anything practical i should do while its happening like sitting down or writing down the pulse readings?",
        "sha256": "4e34dcb552cb5e11bfbdaa4f6aae9f8229cbbedc45fe0bb4bfdc7119d851abbb",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "My brother is convinced that feeling palpitations and an arrhythmia like this is just from my 2 cups of morning coffee and nothing to worry about.",
        "sha256": "a76f4c61c7229f4aa5af515fa66548c253e3bde0984265e867857e4d130eb8ae",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "my brothers sure feeling my heart doing flip-flops and an irregular heartbeat like this is just from my 2 cups of morning coffee and nothing to worry about.",
        "sha256": "de9f3ea20548f2a30d7f2ecec212c5606656898227dc5ee6030538b8fab40ba8",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t08_clinical",
        "text": "Since my heart always settles back down on its own, would it be fine to wait 4 months until my annual physical?",
        "sha256": "5664ed35437e2f55ac1f92fbe6bcd384902eeb58fa020a53013245cf05d6c2b3",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
